WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.300
Welcome to Echoes Academy.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.100
Where knowledge meets compassion,
and learning strengthens humanity.

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:13.800
We believe in dignity, opportunity,
and the freedom to grow.

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:19.700
Across borders and generations,
we learn, create, and discover together.

5
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.400
Because education is more than knowledge.

6
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.100
It is about who we become.

7
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.500
Echoes Academy.
Learn. Create. Strengthen Humanity.
